The '''Bingo Rod''' is a {{Rare}} [[Fishing Rod]].

== Obtaining ==
The '''Bingo Rod''' may be offered when talking to {{NPCSprite|Bingo}} on a [[Bingo#Bingo Modes|Special Bingo]] profile after completing a set number of goals.

